I'll translate that since this is the beginners' list: "Hey selckiku,
would you agree to us helping?"

You're musical too, .aionys.?  Do you play an instrument?  Any singers
out there other than me?

I'd been working more on my novel.  But if an opera is what y'all want
I can work more on that sooner.  Would you like me to provide you a
libretto, and you can set it to music?  It could have various songs
written by various people in various styles, that sounds interesting.

My target medium isn't really the stage, but rather an audio
recording.  I figured people could record their lines and then we
could stitch it all together.  I suppose there could also be
incidental music behind the spoken parts.

